    "created_at": "2017-09-07T17:10:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-07T17:10:05Z",
    "body": "Elements don't contain HTML markup; they contain other elements. And template isn't allowed to contain other elements.\r\n\r\nI think you are confusing the written HTML source string with the content model, which governs the DOM tree. The example below the paragraph I pointed to makes this disctinction clear.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
