    "updated_at": "2017-09-07T17:33:53Z",
    "body": "It does seem that https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#elements-2 uses \"content model\" to govern the content between a start and end tag, and no special casing is made for the `template` element. Am I missing something?",
