    "created_at": "2017-09-07T18:01:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-07T18:01:28Z",
    "body": "Well, my interpretation of that section is that it's actually impossible to put contents between the template start and end tags that would violate its content model, since doing so does not create any elements.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
