    "created_at": "2017-09-07T18:10:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-07T18:10:58Z",
    "body": "Yes, I’m aware it says “content model” not just “content”, but 1) when one search the documentation, it is typically to check what can be in what, and this is typically in written form 2) there must be an initial representation to fill-up a model anyway. That’s why I was confused and I believe some others may be.\r\n\r\nWhere we may agree is to say there is some confusion between textual representation and abstract model.\r\n\r\nI won’t insist, I just wanted to say.\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
