    "body": "@sideshowbarker the *template contents* are distinct from the children. The content model governs the children, and there are not allowed to be any children (hence \"Nothing\"). That is, the following is non-conforming because it violates the content model:\r\n\r\n```\r\ntemplateElement.appendChild(document.createTextNode('Hello'));\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
