    "updated_at": "2017-09-11T10:54:19Z",
    "body": "Yep! And the content model applies to the DOM tree (which arises from HTML writing, DOM manipulation, XHR's contentDocument, etc.), not just to the written HTML source. That is the misunderstanding of content model that so far you and one other person have had, and that we wrote a large paragrah and a large example to clarify, and that we really wish people would read down just a bit further to understand.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
